1
00:00:00,188 --> 00:00:02,158
(Wil:)And we're back.

2
00:00:02,157 --> 00:00:05,697
(Penny:)Leonard, why are you making
such a big deal out of this?

3
00:00:05,694 --> 00:00:08,364
(Penny:)So our roles have changed a bit
over the last couple years.

4
00:00:08,363 --> 00:00:09,563
(Penny:)This is the way life is.

5
00:00:09,564 --> 00:00:11,894
(Penny:)And I'm sure in time
they'll change again.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,200
(Leonard:)Great, you're not only
more successful than me,

7
00:00:15,203 --> 00:00:17,373
(Leonard:)now you're more mature.

8
00:00:17,372 --> 00:00:19,402
(Penny:)Okay, look, would it
make you feel better

9
00:00:19,408 --> 00:00:22,778
(Penny:)if I did something dumb like
sneak out of work one day

10
00:00:22,778 --> 00:00:25,248
(Penny:)to go audition for
a Kevin Smith movie?

11
00:00:25,247 --> 00:00:27,517
That would be great, thank you!

12
00:00:29,016 --> 00:00:30,186
(Wil:)I'm just gonna jump
in here real quick.

13
00:00:30,185 --> 00:00:31,785
(Wil:)Leonard, a moment ago,

14
00:00:31,787 --> 00:00:35,017
(Wil:)you were dead set against Penny
resuming her acting career,

15
00:00:35,023 --> 00:00:36,593
(Wil:)but now you're all for it.

16
00:00:36,591 --> 00:00:39,791
(Wil:)Is it fair to say that
she played you like a violin?

17
00:00:41,195 --> 00:00:43,435
(Leonard:)Yes, it is, Wil.

18
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,130
(Josh:)So, I have to ask,

19
00:00:48,136 --> 00:00:50,466
(Josh:)was the robot sexy?

20
00:00:50,472 --> 00:00:52,542
(chuckles)
It was actually

21
00:00:52,541 --> 00:00:55,211
(Howard:)just a mechanical hand.

22
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:58,450
'Cause that's all
you need, right?

23
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:03,020
(Howard:)You are my brother.

